@CC =================================================================
@CC = FILE NAME: TCP-OPTFIX-D02:MODE
@CC = PATCH OF THE TCP OPTION PARSER IN THE LOADED D02 FIRMWARE.
@CC = RUN AFTER TCP-IP-LO-D02:MODE AND BEFORE TCP-START-D02:MODE.
@CC = TCP-IP-LO-D02 LOADS BANK 0 FROM THE BPUN FILE AGAIN EVERY TIME,
@CC = SO THIS FILE MUST BE RUN AFTER EVERY TCP-IP-LO-D02.
@CC = 68000 ADDRESS 16E14H = SEGMENT TCPS0B0 WORD 133412B
@CC = OLD 022156B (24 6E, START OF MOVEA.L 14(A6),A2)
@CC = NEW 060050B (60 28, BRA.B 16E3EH)
@CC = AN OPTION KIND ABOVE 2 NOW ENDS THE OPTION WALK WITHOUT
@CC = THE TCPP INVALID ARGUMENT REPORT.
@CC = CHECK THE LIST: IT MUST SHOW  133412/ 022156 60050
@CC =================================================================
@LOOK-AT SEGMENT TCPS0B0
133412/60050
.
